Build an 8-bit shift register with parallel load, shift right, and asynchronous reset.
// (1) load: Loads the shift register with the input value. Active high.
// (2) shift: Shifts the register to the right. Active high.
// (3) reset: Asynchronous reset of the register. Active high.
// (4) clk: Clock signal.
// (5) load_val: 8-bit input value to load into the register.
// (6) q: 8-bit output of the shift register.
module top_module(
