description:
Design a circuit that functions as an edge-triggered enabler controlling an output based on the inputs. The module holds the state of the enable signal when the input is LOW and outputs a HIGH only when the enable signal is active (HIGH) while the input is also HIGH. Thus, it effectively ensures that the output is activated by the enable signal only during the periods when the input goes inactive.
module top_module(
  output out,
  input en,
  input in
);

